                <divLine xml:id="m-bcc15a3a-9742-4910-84e4-78136bfef0e0" facs="#m-b29804e4-974b-4db1-a897-29724553e4ff" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-1c2d9204-cf27-4985-907f-e3c168984000">
              <lg xml:id="m-1bd4f9d4-a4b7-486c-8cca-b81794638036">
                <l xml:id="m-ce7ee898-6c1e-4cdf-94cd-6cfd18f50a22" facs="#m-941b5a07-b501-413b-9cdc-2c987d17eb28" label="text-like">The Solemn afternoon Liturgy</l><l xml:id="m-97c1e97d-b63c-4baf-8694-083bb5922a0e" facs="#m-56b64593-3891-414c-af50-7e3dbcaddc89" label="ambiguous">737</l><l xml:id="m-521dcc65-9760-40ef-bedf-d1e3400d15f7" facs="#m-2218af12-68bc-47b5-b31a-f31433a433f2" label="text-like">sacred ministers, servers and all who have returned from the adoration of the</l><l xml:id="m-481f4f75-7233-449a-8c74-21c0400c83d8" facs="#m-a83b9d7f-38fa-42ec-89a1-1b1ef3c46145" label="text-like">Cross sit and listen.</l><l xml:id="m-0401a28b-1039-4871-9603-1e1c6a0281b9" facs="#m-f2852a24-7422-4cc2-9d8f-da050d629847" label="text-like">The sineine is continued for as long as the adoration continues. It always</l><l xml:id="m-81acc3d6-a44a-4d12-a15c-6db5c6ac7aaa" facs="#m-2b694268-3c56-4b47-a864-4735f600c212" label="lyrics-like">ends vith the doxology Sempitérna sit beâtae Trinitáti glória from the hymn</l><l xml:id="m-a889083a-9e27-427d-ac3b-74ababcc5ded" facs="#m-229867c7-2b8a-43ff-944a-a6aa2228992a" label="lyrics-like">Pánge, lingua, gloriósi lauream certáminis, p. 745.</l><l xml:id="m-d9c9e25a-6792-469c-8824-5a20b7a2c329" facs="#m-95cc3372-3812-4656-b8bc-cb0a2776971e" label="text-like">THE REPROACHES</l><l xml:id="m-4ec0dbc9-6fec-4c48-b7d3-65e1cd03e4c1" facs="#m-8bcd17f1-1a16-49c0-b22e-7ba4303d3661" label="text-like">Everything is sung as indicated in various boohs of Gregorian chant, or</l><l xml:id="m-2f56cf9a-660e-416a-b9a5-d5cd69c3a661" facs="#m-0343978d-2831-4793-9246-5ff30330b94e" label="ambiguous">as below.</l><l xml:id="m-8a655e80-1c9d-4dac-90fe-c360b51bb2f9" facs="#m-c760d184-4fc6-4ec8-9236-096d00a1b539" label="text-like">Two Cantors sing the follouing in the middle of the Choir:</l><l xml:id="m-1431d7d9-b5bf-4539-8d58-e1bd11396682" facs="#m-d5c408b6-40dd-42ca-9005-e91fc98cf208" label="ambiguous">Y. 1</l><l xml:id="m-1d31713f-2694-475b-9e72-066e5ea5e33a" facs="#m-9447b32d-b800-498c-954f-7edf11df7ac2" label="lyrics-like">Opu-le mé-us, quid fé- ci tí-bi? Aut in quo</l><l xml:id="m-39939f74-e6bb-41cd-9e2e-59cef63a20c2" facs="#m-f4adb6af-1aff-4ba3-8098-c9ec30c44159" label="lyrics-like">Respónde mí-hi. Y. Qui¬ a e-dú-xi</l><l xml:id="m-8a5a0b5b-f4ad-4ad0-bbda-21f22007e2ce" facs="#m-799e8b5c-7840-4cba-9197-e0b990c35aaa" label="lyrics-like">contristávi te?</l><l xml:id="m-f0f63213-e6cb-45aa-8477-5b29c46d969f" facs="#m-08f93966-9790-4542-87f2-4c039c9a1a75" label="lyrics-like">sti Crúcem Sal¬</l><l xml:id="m-414ce614-9c86-4776-8fb9-2d8ee1748313" facs="#m-002632e4-b3d5-4cc1-a17a-434b7fe470e2" label="ambiguous">Ægypti:</l><l xml:id="m-31a2d2f6-453f-40f1-998c-748b9b4bee50" facs="#m-2372a372-e399-4bce-9536-5efd7f10ce46" label="lyrics-like">te de térra</l><l xml:id="m-43a20c43-4f57-4e57-a843-8f93801ead90" facs="#m-5d413999-3106-40a8-b896-534835941563" label="lyrics-like">pa-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-5393c66a-c352-459b-9bee-cfe9f2ba7fc1" facs="#m-f4e96f3c-256b-427d-bef5-fc392a3abd69" label="lyrics-like">va-tó-ri tú-O.</l><l xml:id="m-ed4d530a-4ec2-4e70-acd4-0ce8b4a59410" facs="#m-ae5196c8-8b7b-40d4-83fb-48699117820e" label="text-like">The other choir answvers:</l><l xml:id="m-1727e3b1-6086-4ee3-8bc6-8f8cd7f64e05" facs="#m-a138bd8a-50fc-482a-b133-4d25ae914d26" label="ambiguous">One choir sines:</l><l xml:id="m-5e8aa931-4c5c-48c4-9af7-3fb77c50d6f4" facs="#m-682f3e52-b8a8-48bd-b92a-f9b7df6f2212" label="ambiguous">S</l><l xml:id="m-e68d034f-da0a-499e-8efb-bd7454abb89f" facs="#m-6cf51a34-0f53-4427-985e-95930e760f41" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-2092afe1-9dea-4279-8d91-ff8318b1c659" facs="#m-00c968e7-5411-410c-95e8-e91e98efec51" label="lyrics-like">Anctus Dé-us.</l><l xml:id="m-dc44e67e-83d2-480a-b503-ecbc518858aa" facs="#m-01fddbb0-daee-45ae-a6c2-f2cc2c738e60" label="lyrics-like">0 The-ós.</l><l xml:id="m-563fba2a-3f2a-47ec-b8a9-5aa0a6a7c199" facs="#m-ee7731dc-7ac6-4650-a2af-408ffc1a5873" label="ambiguous">Agi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac152d79-2c43-42e9-a4c9-ca6e80527ad3" facs="#m-4691a056-3d37-405c-85aa-1f7f8f27b892" label="text-like">The second choir:</l><l xml:id="m-9e5bbd59-ec94-4e12-b427-ec57a6f7df48" facs="#m-1e5da889-de96-4037-ba5f-2b94b9953058" label="text-like">The first choir:</l><l xml:id="m-01053630-79fc-4861-ba7a-39a7993e2e95" facs="#m-0ba86932-e12d-4fbf-b93a-ea01f1445d9e" label="ambiguous">S</l><l xml:id="m-c338238f-2d41-4ce7-896d-a3377baa6d81" facs="#m-a546a3a8-0123-4a72-bbc5-1600653423d9" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-c295a0d9-5f02-40b4-8d71-a4450c38852c" facs="#m-b09703fa-cc6d-45cb-bfd3-5b47fe1f9b6a" label="lyrics-like">Ischy-rós.</l><l xml:id="m-2ce095a2-9783-462a-af31-d6142b001976" facs="#m-f5beb916-b4f0-4251-8f91-e444ade04c77" label="lyrics-like">Anctus Fórtis.</l><l xml:id="m-436e114d-a97f-4d45-b2d6-e8cfcab0c4b5" facs="#m-618a3be0-61f0-4b94-9e38-4a3ea9ffbfc3" label="ambiguous">Agi- os</l><l xml:id="m-966cda6d-76b6-4619-a780-f7251bd8cb66" facs="#m-a05c215a-aa85-4bc2-85d1-63a6d3003a69" label="text-like">The first choir:</l><l xml:id="m-ae210948-c0b0-4593-aa27-fc20981a63e0" facs="#m-526f66f4-4314-4b4d-8cb1-cfd8f4253c6d" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-8664db1c-216d-49f7-bebb-2716e608ad6b" facs="#m-36694ea5-74e3-4df2-8d75-4ab39fda0127" label="lyrics-like">Athánatos,</l><l xml:id="m-5fbb176b-cbc2-4dc8-98de-e06ca0a072df" facs="#m-7d5734f3-bb2e-4ad1-ad4a-9c4da5183d7a" label="lyrics-like">e lé¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd829e48-df99-4977-8a5f-c72804989285" facs="#m-9b1e4418-54c3-4047-bbde-97b050298bdc" label="ambiguous">Agi¬ os</l><l xml:id="m-d04816f0-7149-48b4-a1d3-c38e4632a3c5" facs="#m-3230bd09-5bc7-4b2d-8636-b8df224f8d9f" label="lyrics-like">i-son hymás.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
